# knit's Osc 2 page (testers: more from osc 2): EDIT's fifth page on a knit track, after Sub. wave (same: osc 1's, by
# default; saw, square, pulse, triangle, sine), shape (osc 2's own saw .. square .. pulse, set where the wave sits when
# the wave turns to one of those; "-" for the others), fine (+-50 cents, here now: HOME on Sub no longer turns it).
# Another engine has no such page; the values stay over a restart and in a user preset, a factory preset sets them back
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine knit
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 4
expect page Osc_2
expect par3.o2wave 0
expect par3.o2shape 0
listen
wait 400
said Osc 2
shot osc2_same.png
# the wave: saw, square, pulse each set the shape where they sit
spin K1 1
wait 400
said wave saw
expect par3.o2wave 1
expect par3.o2shape 0
spin K1 1
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
spin K1 1
expect par3.o2wave 3
expect par3.o2shape 127
spin K2 -27
expect par3.o2shape 100
# with osc 2 heard (its level on Sub) at a fifth: the picture
knob 3 x1 71
knob 3 x2 90
wait 40
shot osc2_pulse.png
spin K1 1
expect par3.o2wave 4
wait 400
said wave triangle
spin K1 1
expect par3.o2wave 5
spin K1 1
expect par3.o2wave 5
spin K1 -3
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
# fine: here, in cents
spin K3 12
expect par3.fine 76
wait 400
said fine +12 ct
wait 40
shot osc2_square.png
# Osc 2 is EDIT's last page: SELECT wraps to Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
turn SELECT -1
expect page Osc_2
# HOME held on Sub turns osc 2's interval, as without it: the shortcut to fine is gone
turn SELECT -1
expect page Sub
press HOME
wait 600
spin K1 2
release HOME
wait 40
expect par3.x1 73
expect par3.fine 76
expect page Sub
# kept over a restart
projsave 1
reboot
wait 400
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
expect par3.fine 76
# a user preset keeps them, a factory preset sets them back to osc 1's wave
usersave 3 3
preset 3 reese
expect par3.o2wave 0
expect par3.o2shape 0
expect par3.fine 64
preset 3 U3
expect par3.o2wave 2
expect par3.o2shape 64
expect par3.fine 76
reboot
wait 400
preset 3 U3
expect par3.o2wave 2
# another engine: no Osc 2 page (on it: back to the first page)
tap EDIT
turn SELECT 4
expect page Osc_2
knob 3 engine rayon
wait 40
expect page Engine
expect par3.o2wave 0
turn SELECT 4
expect page Engine
